---
import DefaultShell from "../layouts/DefaultShell.astro";
import { getPageByUrl } from "../lib/pages";
const page = getPageByUrl("/404.html");
---
<DefaultShell page={page}>
  <div class="not-found" lang="en-GB">
    <p>The page you asked for is not here. It may have moved, or it may never have existed.</p>
    <p class="not-found__links"><a href="/">Go to the home page</a> · <a href="/faq/">Read the FAQ</a> · <a href="/glossary/">Browse the glossary</a></p>
  </div>
  <div class="not-found" lang="zh-TW">
    <p class="not-found__title" lang="zh-TW">這條路已經退場。</p>
    <p>你要找的頁面不在這裡，可能已經搬家，也可能從來沒有存在過。</p>
    <p class="not-found__links"><a href="/tw/">回到首頁</a> · <a href="/tw/faq/">閱讀常見問答</a> · <a href="/tw/glossary/">查看詞彙表</a></p>
  </div>
</DefaultShell>
